{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game","id":62895,"title":"Abbandon all hope all ye who enter here- I'm doing an Abyssal game!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Abyssal Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-01T07:22:28-08:00","id":62895,"title":"Abbandon all hope all ye who enter here- I'm doing an Abyssal game!","content":"So, I'm getting tired of waiting for 3e and knowing that even when it comes I'm gonna need to wait probably a year more untill Abyssal expansion comes out. And since I'm filled with ideas and anxiety which will go unrealised for another couple of years if I don't act, I decided to do this now.<br /> <br /> Some basic information: I am on a short break from school due to exams (I know, sounds weird) so I have a lot of free time on my hands right now. what this means, is that practically any hour and any days of the weak fit my schedule. I live in GMT +1 timezone though, so I understand that it will probably mean playing during nights for me. 6 hour bridge does that. The game can take place on Skype or any other similar program I might not be aware of (courtesy of Totalbuiscuit, I was made aware of roll20, which I am eager to try out). It can hopefully be realised as video confference game, but I will not push for it (as I would have to buy a mic myself, but at least I'd have an incentive to do so).<br /> <br /> As for the game itself: we'll be playing 2.5 with a few minor changes, such as widely accepted rule about Excellencies imported from 3e, and under the rules of appropriate splat expansions. Any additional material suggested by players will be reviewed on case-by-case basis. I want the majority of the party to be Abyssal Exalted, but I'll accept Necromancy-wielding Dragonblooded, Lunars and Sidereals of Endings also on case-by-case basis.<br /> <br /> Where the events of our story take place is largely a matter for an open discussion. It largely depends on your preferences- if you guys want to play a game in the West, Pirates of the Caribbean style, I'm game. If you want to take part in the events surrounding the conquest of Thorns in the East, I'm game as well. I'd like to hear you out on where do you want to play and what specific stories are you interested in telling.<br /> <br /> So write here if you want to participate and ask away about anything that interests you!<br /> <br /> (and then I make two mistakes in the title of the thread... That's a great start, bravo, I aplaud myself that's how fucking good that was...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-01-2014, 10:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T07:36:04-08:00","id":62904,"title":"","content":"I have tentative interest.<br /> <br /> What I mean is that video conference doesn't really work for me and I have a couple other late-night games so there are chances that the set-up doesn't work for me. I'm GMT+1 as well, so if this could happen at a decent hour for both of us, and on a written chat, that would great and I'd totally be in. If not, it's no problem - I'm sure there are other interested players^^","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T07:40:39-08:00","id":62905,"title":"","content":"I'm curious if you might allow alchemicals or infernals that have a bent towards the dead or necromancy as well","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T07:51:19-08:00","id":62907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62905#post62905\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm curious if you might allow alchemicals or infernals that have a bent towards the dead or necromancy as well</div> </div> </div> </div>No. Infernals are one thing I am wholeheartedly unwilling to let PCs play this time, <i>especially</i> Infernals bent towards destruction and necromancy because that means TED and that will overshadow the entire game. I am unwilling to put up with this. As for Alchemicals... No, I don't think I'd allow that. Thing is- I don't want to waste the story on talking about &quot;the first contact&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T07:53:43-08:00","id":62908,"title":"","content":"for alchemicals I was thinking more along the lines of an experiment gone wrong sent a group to the underworld and infernals ted wouldn't be on the table, for me at least<br /> <br /> thanks for answering though","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T08:03:59-08:00","id":62909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62908#post62908\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">for alchemicals I was thinking more along the lines of an experiment gone wrong sent a group to the underworld and infernals ted wouldn't be on the table, for me at least<br /> <br /> thanks for answering though</div> </div> </div> </div>Dunno, maybe you can persuade me that your character has something to bring to the table. What stories would you want to explore with this alchemical and how can it help the Abyssal theme of the game? I never had much experience with Alchies so I don't know how can they enrich and Abyssal game, if they can then maybe we can make this work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T08:08:26-08:00","id":62911,"title":"","content":"As Omicron: tentative interest, and not in favour of the video conference thing. All text-based media are fine, though.<br /> I'll hang around and see what other people are interested, and what they're interested <i>in</i>, before I make any commitments.<br /> <br /> EDIT: We're in the same timezone, in case it matters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":97,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","user":"The MG","date":". 02-01-2014, 11:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/97-the-mg","name":"The MG","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar97_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2460"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T08:40:46-08:00","id":62917,"title":"","content":"Tentative interest as well. Do you have anything that could speak for your ST style or gives an example of a session/campaign? An Obsidian Portal page perhaps?<br /> <br /> My gaming schedule is in some flux at the moment but I should know shortly what times I'll be free and available.<br /> <br /> ((I'd be willing to play an Abyssal or Lunar. What direction is this likely to take place? I have my own visions of Mask of Winters so he can be a toss up between super cool and a lame duck to me. Lover Clad is a lot of fun though regardless. I'd really like to tell a story that related to the Lintha Ghosts in such a game. Perhaps something akin to a double agent. Lintha given an Abyssal Exaltation so the Deathlords could spy on one of their chief enemies - but family loyalty won out and I defected to serve the Lintha Dead and gaining a measure of protection within the embrace of the Lintha once more. Perhaps my Deathlord even thinks its a ploy to accomplish my mission of infiltrating the Lintha and that I'm still loyal.))","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1066,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","user":"The Despot","date":". 02-01-2014, 11:47 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T08:47:44-08:00","id":62920,"title":"","content":"I am so ready for this one. Talk about the game posting of my dreams I am open to this as long as the selected time is not Friday-Sunday as that is my dedicated family time and then anytime during the week after 6:00 pm EST. I would love to play an abyssal game that is not actively bent on trying to be redeemed. Also, are you going to do the regular Resonance or the modified rule from Shards? My interest is either the Dusk or Midnight caste.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/385-savare","name":"Savare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:01:03-08:00","id":62924,"title":"","content":"Since this would seem to be a recruitment thread, you probably want to move it over to the correct forum.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Odd_Canuck is not a topical medication or food product and is not to be taken internally or seriously.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/31-odd_canuck","name":"Odd_Canuck","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar31_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1474"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:05:30-08:00","id":62926,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Despot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62917#post62917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Tentative interest as well. Do you have anything that could speak for your ST style or gives an example of a session? A Obsidian Portal page perhaps?<br /> <br /> My gaming schedule is in some flux at the moment but I should know shortly what times I'll be free and available.</div> </div> </div> </div>I am entirely unfamiliar with Obsidian Portal. I don't think I can present a tangible evidence of my style. Best I can do is just tell you what my games have been historically about. I think the best way to describe what I do with my stories would be... Philosophical ramblings on human condition. I know, that sounds waaay too pretencious for what it's really about, but yeah, that's kinda what I like doing- telling stories about passion, desperation, persecutaion, irony, loss, love and so on...<br /> <br /> I am a very forgiving GM and I just want you guys to have fun, I'm confident the heartbreaking story will develop on it's own, it always have.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:16:29-08:00","id":62930,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FromBeyond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62926#post62926\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am entirely unfamiliar with Obsidian Portal. I don't think I can present a tangible evidence of my style. Best I can do is just tell you what my games have been historically about. I think the best way to describe what I do with my stories would be... Philosophical ramblings on human condition. I know, that sounds waaay too pretencious for what it's really about, but yeah, that's kinda what I like doing- telling stories about passion, desperation, persecutaion, irony, loss, love and so on...<br /> <br /> I am a very forgiving GM and I just want you guys to have fun, I'm confident the heartbreaking story will develop on it's own, it always have.</div> </div> </div> </div>Interest is piqued.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:22:48-08:00","id":62932,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Savare</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62920#post62920\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am so ready for this one. Talk about the game posting of my dreams I am open to this as long as the selected time is not Friday-Sunday as that is my dedicated family time and then anytime during the week after 6:00 pm EST. I would love to play an abyssal game that is not actively bent on trying to be redeemed. Also, are you going to do the regular Resonance or the modified rule from Shards? My interest is either the Dusk or Midnight caste.</div> </div> </div> </div>I do not own shards and thus am unfamiliar with the actual way this remake works, though I've heard a lot good about it. I'd be interested in finding out how it works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:34:18-08:00","id":62944,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Despot</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62917#post62917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">((I'd be willing to play an Abyssal or Lunar. What direction is this likely to take place? I have my own visions of Mask of Winters so he can be a toss up between super cool and a lame duck to me. Lover Clad is a lot of fun though regardless. I'd really like to tell a story that related to the Lintha Ghosts in such a game. Perhaps something akin to a double agent. Lintha given an Abyssal Exaltation so the Deathlords could spy on one of their chief enemies - but family loyalty won out and I defected to serve the Lintha Dead and gaining a measure of protection within the embrace of the Lintha once more. Perhaps my Deathlord even thinks its a ploy to accomplish my mission of infiltrating the Lintha and that I'm still loyal.))</div> </div> </div> </div>Sorry, didn't notice the edit before posting. I'd be interested in hearing what would your vision of the Mask be? I have some ideas of my own- originally I wanted to present him as a very dramatic figure. As for Lintha ghosts plotline- sure, provided it's gonna be compatible with where the game takes place. There is a lot of ways this can be done, you could be free Deathknight in the vein of the Ink Monkeys article, a rogue Deathknight broken off from the Deathlord's rule or even a loyalist. I am unwilling to constrain you, at all, if possible- the Deathlords are there to create a towering background, but they aren't the alfa and omega of your existance. As far as I'm concerned, you can very well be a loyalist and speak with your Deathlord casually once every few months even if you're technically in conflict. I am uninterested in playing the game &quot;as advised&quot; by the source book. I still miss the early days of 1e Abyssals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-01-2014, 01:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:39:18-08:00","id":62948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FromBeyond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62932#post62932\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do not own shards and thus am unfamiliar with the actual way this remake works, though I've heard a lot good about it. I'd be interested in finding out how it works.</div> </div> </div> </div>It's work like the Solar's Great Curse, the more Resonance you have, the more weird stuffs start to happen around the Abyssal: white noise on TV, demon hands start to appear on ceiling, and this thing following you whenever you go~<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://netanimations.net/Animated-clip-art-picture-of-ceiling-crawling-girl-creature.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>The no.1 fan of Demetheus. I also draw <a href=\"https://probably-unreliable.tumblr.com/tagged/Jenart\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted</a> things and is looking for commission works ~","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/298-jen","name":"Jen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar298_5.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T09:43:04-08:00","id":62950,"title":"","content":"Ehhhh-heheheh<br /> <br /> <i>Mua-hah-hahahahhhhh!!!!</i><br /> <br /> I'm quite interested in doing an Abyssals game, actually, although I'd need to discuss time with you in a bit. I've actually got numerous good concepts waiting in the wings, as well, so...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/781-chained-divinity","name":"Chained Divinity","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar781_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T10:03:23-08:00","id":62965,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chained Divinity</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62950#post62950\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Ehhhh-heheheh<br /> <br /> <i>Mua-hah-hahahahhhhh!!!!</i><br /> <br /> I'm quite interested in doing an Abyssals game, actually, although I'd need to discuss time with you in a bit. I've actually got numerous good concepts waiting in the wings, as well, so...</div> </div> </div> </div>Your enthusiasm is greatly appreciated.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T10:05:35-08:00","id":62968,"title":"","content":"The Hand Behind The Fallen Axe<br /> <br /> The Last Man Standing Upon The Blood Strew Field Wreaked In Gore<br /> <br /> She Who Walks Beside<br /> <br /> Forsaken, Forgotten And Unavenged<br /> <br /> You Will Hear The Screams Of Children<br /> <br /> I think I have most of what I need for an Abyssal character.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T10:29:15-08:00","id":62982,"title":"","content":"Hmm...I'm interested, depending on when this may be happening - possibly with a Daybreak. Any idea of crafting is going to be stock, or Revlid's, or other?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar41_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T11:18:07-08:00","id":63019,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>silverwinglie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=62982#post62982\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmm...I'm interested, depending on when this may be happening - possibly with a Daybreak. Any idea of crafting is going to be stock, or Revlid's, or other?</div> </div> </div> </div>I would greatly appreciate a character with crafting drive, especially a Daybreak. I am unfamiliar with Revlid's work, if he has some interesting Necrotech rewrite, I'd be willing to look into that. I am however of course willing to treat Craft as a single skill as I am well aware of the problems Craft presents. I'd also be quite liberal on the topic of custom Craft charms since the sourcebook does only dicredit to the entire concept.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-01-2014, 03:08 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T12:11:39-08:00","id":63040,"title":"","content":"the idea I have for an alchemical is a soulsteel alchie who was made to chase down a baddie that was stealing souls and hording them in a blight zone. (I say baddie in case you want to use it as a hook or what not) As Eyes Within the Darkness (my alchie name) approaches some necromantic ritual transports the baddie and the small group that came with Eyes to the underworld (its up to you if another alchemical came along and became a city in the underworld for ease of changing charm loadouts).<br /> <br /> He is a rough idea right now, if you want I can put a sheet together and give him more wants and motivations","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T12:19:06-08:00","id":63046,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63040#post63040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the idea I have for an alchemical is a soulsteel alchie who was made to chase down a baddie that was stealing souls and hording them in a blight zone. (I say baddie in case you want to use it as a hook or what not) As Eyes Within the Darkness (my alchie name) approaches some necromantic ritual transports the baddie and the small group that came with Eyes to the underworld (its up to you if another alchemical came along and became a city in the underworld for ease of changing charm loadouts).<br /> <br /> He is a rough idea right now, if you want I can put a sheet together and give him more wants and motivations</div> </div> </div> </div>What I'd rather want to know is how would he enrich an Abyssal story rooted in conflict between fiuture and past, entropy and growth, life and death. I'd want to know how can he bounce off of the Abyssal characters or how can Abyssal characters bounce off of him. In other words: what sort of a story can he tell?<br /> <br /> I'm kind of against that, because I fear him being an alchemical will detract from the story.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-01-2014, 03:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T12:49:49-08:00","id":63060,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FromBeyond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63019#post63019\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would greatly appreciate a character with crafting drive, especially a Daybreak. I am unfamiliar with Revlid's work, if he has some interesting Necrotech rewrite, I'd be willing to look into that. I am however of course willing to treat Craft as a single skill as I am well aware of the problems Craft presents. I'd also be quite liberal on the topic of custom Craft charms since the sourcebook does only dicredit to the entire concept.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm mostly used to Craft-as-presented, somewhat meh on Revlid. I'd probably go Craft: Fire with a lean towards crafting Soulsteel and applicable charms, specialties leaning heavily towards Necrotech - this character being the Artisan of Flesh and Bones. A lot spent into Medicine (towards reshaping peoples' forms with a possible jaunt into the plague charms eventually) as well and some necromancy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar41_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T13:00:37-08:00","id":63065,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>silverwinglie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63060#post63060\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm mostly used to Craft-as-presented, somewhat meh on Revlid. I'd probably go Craft: Fire with a lean towards crafting Soulsteel and applicable charms, specialties leaning heavily towards Necrotech - this character being the Artisan of Flesh and Bones. A lot spent into Medicine (towards reshaping peoples' forms with a possible jaunt into the plague charms eventually) as well and some necromancy.</div> </div> </div> </div>I certainly approve of the concept. If you are bent on treating Craft as 5+ different skills... I guess I can let that happen? But for the sake of my blood-vessels and your bonus points, I'd really appreciate if you just treated it as a single skill.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T13:01:33-08:00","id":63068,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FromBeyond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63065#post63065\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I certainly approve of the concept. If you are bent on treating Craft as 5+ different skills... I guess I can let that happen? But for the sake of my blood-vessels and your bonus points, I'd really appreciate if you just treated it as a single skill.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is fine with me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/41-silverwinglie","name":"silverwinglie","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar41_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"82"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T14:13:50-08:00","id":63113,"title":"","content":"Well, I'm not really interested, but have some custom charms from the Abyssal Game I'm running!<br /> <br /> Peace of the Grave<br /> Permanent Charm, Resistance 3, Essence 2<br /> Prerequisite: Cadaverous Torpor Technique<br /> This charm enhances it's prerequisite, multiplying healing rates while in torpor by (essence). When the user has also been given a proper burial, the factor is instead (Essence + resistance), and it accelerates the healing rate of aggravated damage as well. The DM is encouraged to be liberal with the definition of 'proper burial' to facilitate stunts.<br /> <br /> This charm counts as Wound-Absorbing Discipline for the purposes of qualifying for other charms, as it is a variant charm.<br /> <br /> (One time, the character with this charm was sent blasting off by the guy he accidentally set up as the next Scarlet Emperor, put an obol in under his tongue and prepared to punch the ground as he landed so that he was buried, with a headstone from a boulder he broke with his ranged punch charm. Seeing as this guy was a Solar in disguise, he had a lot of agg damage to heal.)<br /> <br /> Body-Mutilating Bluff<br /> 2m Simple, Larceny 3 Essence 2<br /> Indefinite, Keywords Combo-OK, Crippling<br /> This charm allows the Abyssal to impose any crippling injury on himself deliberately. He actually has the injury, but can reflexively end the charm. A Manipulation+Larceny roll vs. a Wits+Awareness roll determines how off-guard people would be from the sudden unmaimed status of the Abyssal. The Abyssal must be able to survive the Crippling effect, so nothing that hurts the neck, brain, or heart. However, while the Injury may be at any stage of healing cosmetically, it is always treated as sufficiently healed to bestow no complications beyond the obvious. This charm may bestow scars, amputations, missing non-vital organs, and all sorts of other survivable nastiness. This is capable of reducing his Physical Attributes or Appearance if desired.<br /> <br /> As a side-note, while this charm usually banishes any missing organ or limb Elsewhere, the Abyssal can forgo this benefit and merely detach them. This is harder to reverse, and the organ or limb must be place back in his body/held to the stump to release the charm without complication. Otherwise, dismissal of the charm imposes the amputation effect for real.<br /> <br /> Mockery of Insanity Defense<br /> 5m Reflexive(2), Integrity 5 Essence 3<br /> Indefinite, Keywords Combo-OK, Illusion<br /> Prerequisete: Body-Mutilating Bluff<br /> This charm allows the Abyssal to impose &quot;crippling&quot; effects on his own brain and psyche, imposing upon himself a derangement, illusion, or compulsion, lower his Virtues, mental attributes, manipulation or charisma, or even his Abilities, specialties, and it is even capable of making him forget his non-permanent charms. This charm can be used as a Perfect Dodge against mental attacks by changing the Abyssal's perspective enough to void the influence. This charm is also capable of making the Abyssal believe anything, acting as a roundabout lying charm by making him believe whatever he was lying about is the unmitigated truth. The Abyssal's player has full control over the activation and release of this charm, although the Abyssal himself doesn't necessarily have such control, as would usually be the case when giving himself a delusion to lie about something(awful hard to believe something's the truth when you remember that you made yourself believe that, after all).<br /> <br /> Simulacrum Attendance Preperation<br /> 5m, Simple, Larceny 4, Essence 3<br /> Indefinite, Keywords Combo-OK, Illusion<br /> Prerequisite: Face-Drinking Bite<br /> This useful charm allows the Abyssal to keep a long-term disguise while still being able to skip off to meet with his leige or kill babies or whatever gets his rocks off. The Absysal takes a corpse, fashions it with some basic props, and animates it with his essence. The Simulacrum then proceeds to fully act out whatever role the Abyssal desires of it, using the Abyssal's attributes and abilities when needed, although it is an extra. The Simulacrum cannot break character, but the Abyssal can seamlessly switch places with the body if it is within line of sight with a miscellaneous action. The Simulacrum is then disguised as the Abyssal or whatever the disguise the Abyssal was wearing at the time. The Disguise may be enhanced by committing additional motes to Face-Drinking Bite and expending Willpower to False Heart Mein, only the Simulacrum receives the benefits.<br /> <br /> As a point of clarification, Abyssal Disguise charms are activated per disguise, no matter if the Abyssal or a simulacrum is disguised as it. If the Abyssal had used Face-Drinking Bite and then prepared a Simulacrum of that disguise to attend a secret meeting, the Simulacrum would have the benefits of Face-drinking Bite, and the Abyssal would have to re-activate the charms for his new disguise to attend the meeting in if necessary. As long as the motes remain committed, the Abyssal could re-enter the original disguise and not need to re-expend the motes and willpower.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/673-requiem_jeer","name":"Requiem_Jeer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar673_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T14:27:53-08:00","id":63119,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FromBeyond</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63046#post63046\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What I'd rather want to know is how would he enrich an Abyssal story rooted in conflict between fiuture and past, entropy and growth, life and death. I'd want to know how can he bounce off of the Abyssal characters or how can Abyssal characters bounce off of him. In other words: what sort of a story can he tell?<br /> <br /> I'm kind of against that, because I fear him being an alchemical will detract from the story.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm wanting him to be picked up by a deathlord and placed in a group of abyssals. The crafter will probably want to pick him apart to see what makes him work and he will mitigate the abyssal's resonance issues if you do decide to stay with canon resonance just because he is a soulsteel alch. He will be interested in what the abyssals are and how their powers work as well. I will play him more as a blood hound with his perception charms. I'm not planning on a heavy combat build but plan more towards he marks targets for the combat monster to take out.<br /> <br /> without knowing more about the rest of the group it's kinda hard to say how he would work out with them and how I can have him fill his niche","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T14:56:15-08:00","id":63135,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63119#post63119\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I'm wanting him to be picked up by a deathlord and placed in a group of abyssals. The crafter will probably want to pick him apart to see what makes him work and he will mitigate the abyssal's resonance issues if you do decide to stay with canon resonance just because he is a soulsteel alch. He will be interested in what the abyssals are and how their powers work as well. I will play him more as a blood hound with his perception charms. I'm not planning on a heavy combat build but plan more towards he marks targets for the combat monster to take out.<br /> <br /> without knowing more about the rest of the group it's kinda hard to say how he would work out with them and how I can have him fill his niche</div> </div> </div> </div>I've fallen in love with the Resonance rework in Shadrs so I'll try to push that for the game. That aside... I'd really like to know what sort of a character is this guy, because I can't seem to clearly picture it, could you maybe tell me what feeling would you want the story to evoke in you? What sort of ideas would you like to see expanded upon in this game? Like, whether you'd like to feel melancholic or angered, or scared, or amazed, or moved, or something like that? Or what kind of themes you'd like to see in a game, is it a story exploring the worst bits of humanity? The best bits of humanity? Maybe something very inhuman, maybe you want to tell a story about lack of feelings and it's impliaction.<br /> <br /> See, with Abyssals I pretty much know all this stuff. But with Alchemicals I don't, so you have to explain all that to me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T15:16:47-08:00","id":63146,"title":"","content":"I'd like to see him amazed by the full number of ghosts in the underworld, how they shaped it, I'm wanting anger at how they are ruled or treated as nothing, I'm wanting to see the worst in humanity and my alchemical paint the targets exposing the worst so it can be cut away and the best things can flourish in their absence. I'm wanting him to become a monster to fight other monsters and make the world a better place even knowing there is no place for him in this ideal world. As far as feelings and such, I very much want to play him as he fights to remain at least somewhat human while slowly becoming a machine designed to simply target parts of the system that don't work or don't work well enough so they can be removed or re-purposed some how","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T15:37:31-08:00","id":63153,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dezeroth</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63146#post63146\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'd like to see him amazed by the full number of ghosts in the underworld, how they shaped it, I'm wanting anger at how they are ruled or treated as nothing, I'm wanting to see the worst in humanity and my alchemical paint the targets exposing the worst so it can be cut away and the best things can flourish in their absence. I'm wanting him to become a monster to fight other monsters and make the world a better place even knowing there is no place for him in this ideal world. As far as feelings and such, I very much want to play him as he fights to remain at least somewhat human while slowly becoming a machine designed to simply target parts of the system that don't work or don't work well enough so they can be removed or re-purposed some how</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmmm... Ok, tell you what? I'm gonna think on it. It is supposed to be primarilly an Abyssal game so I will wait for answers from people who declared to be interested in that sort of thing. If there is an opening left, I'm gonna you in.<br /> <br /> Even though I'm genuinely interested in how your Alchemical would work out within the story, I want to keep it in theme with what I already have. Does that arrangment work?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T15:41:01-08:00","id":63156,"title":"","content":"works for me, I will get started on his character sheet this weekend and if there is room for me I will ask about some homebrew stuff I've seen for alchies","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/359-dezeroth","name":"Dezeroth","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar359_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"496"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T17:46:49-08:00","id":63193,"title":"","content":"Since people seem to start throwing together characters, is there a particular character generation rules that you want us to follow?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/385-savare","name":"Savare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T20:38:08-08:00","id":63266,"title":"","content":"Abyssals were a splat I never got around to, and I am tentatively interested. I had an idea kicking around of a Daybreak caste whose approach to war and death was very industrial. Automated slaughterhouses that turned slaves and captured prisoners into soulsteel and necrotech weapons and armies in the vein of Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs or Cyrx from Warmachine. Though I haven't actually played either game.<br /> <br /> (I didn't see that times had been decided on yet, but generally I am not a fan of skype games only because there are so many RL things that tend to happen to players that break the flow. I have had some good experiences with Google docs though.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1144-exthalion","name":"Exthalion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1144_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2306"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-01T21:43:13-08:00","id":63284,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Exthalion</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63266#post63266\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Abyssals were a splat I never got around to, and I am tentatively interested. I had an idea kicking around of a Daybreak caste whose approach to war and death was very industrial. Automated slaughterhouses that turned slaves and captured prisoners into soulsteel and necrotech weapons and armies in the vein of Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs or Cyrx from Warmachine. Though I haven't actually played either game.<br /> <br /> (I didn't see that times had been decided on yet, but generally I am not a fan of skype games only because there are so many RL things that tend to happen to players that break the flow. I have had some good experiences with Google docs though.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Ehh automated slaughter houses and manses that summon armies and the like - often the industry become the hero and focus rather than the character. I suppose it could be done in an Atlas Shrugged sorta way, but many people are wary of such things. As long as the foundry still needs necrosurgeons working in them, Warcasters leading the armies and an infrastructure to create a supply chain. Just marching 1000 zombies out an hour that automatically go smash people for you like programmed deathseeker robots without any interaction with npc's or pc's is my fear - particularly when you have no want nor need to depend upon a fellow character nor diplomacy cause you have &quot;infinite army/power/muscle&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1066-the-despot","name":"The Despot","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1066_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T02:11:55-08:00","id":63350,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Savare</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63193#post63193\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Since people seem to start throwing together characters, is there a particular character generation rules that you want us to follow?</div> </div> </div> </div>Standard 2.5 edition, nothing out of the ordinary unless you have a certain desire. But you should just contact me on skype first.<br /> <br /> Also, don't feel pressured, there is plenty of time.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-02-2014, 06:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:52:37-08:00","id":63374,"title":"","content":"Hmmm. After our Abyssals discussion I'd understand why you might be reluctant to have me, but I'd be really interested in this. I'd like to play a Dusk Caste, but I have a few different takes to choose between, so I'd like to know whwre the game's set before I decide which.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher","name":"Schleiermacher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T04:19:35-08:00","id":63378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schleiermacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63374#post63374\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hmmm. After our Abyssals discussion I'd understand why you might be reluctant to have me, but I'd be really interested in this. I'd like to play a Dusk Caste, but I have a few different takes to choose between, so I'd like to know whwre the game's set before I decide which.</div> </div> </div> </div>So far it seems it's gonna be West, the two players I have right now both declared willingness to work for the Skullstone.<br /> <br /> Do bare in mind though, if you want redemption storyline, I can provide. However, don't expect moral validation of that path as the &quot;one and only right thing to do&quot;. But I think that you'll find that we agree more then we disagree on the core aspects of being an Abyssal. Like I've said- I am willing to use the Shards rules for Resonance and they make a very clear statement about what Abyssals are and how their Exaltation works.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2052,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","user":"FromBeyond","date":". 02-02-2014, 07:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T05:19:17-08:00","id":63386,"title":"","content":"Skullstone, eh? Cool. I hope it's 1E &quot;honest&quot; Skullstone and not 2E &quot;scam&quot; Skullstone, but that's up to you, of course. And don't worry, I can play nicely with others. I'm not familiar with Shards Resonance except in the broadest of strokes, but I'll play the hand I'm dealt. I don't expect I'll play a redemption-seeker in this game -I'm usually not very interested in that, actually. I'll send you a first draft and some questions tonight.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2082-schleiermacher","name":"Schleiermacher","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"190"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T05:35:04-08:00","id":63395,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Schleiermacher</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63386#post63386\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Skullstone, eh? Cool. I hope it's 1E &quot;honest&quot; Skullstone and not 2E &quot;scam&quot; Skullstone, but that's up to you, of course. And don't worry, I can play nicely with others. I'm not familiar with Shards Resonance except in the broadest of strokes, but I'll play the hand I'm dealt. I don't expect I'll play a redemption-seeker in this game -I'm usually not very interested in that, actually. I'll send you a first draft and some questions tonight.</div> </div> </div> </div>You will note that I specifically said &quot;for Skullstone&quot; and not &quot;for the Silver Prince&quot;. It's a classical, honset to god, deadly transhumanist Skullstone and the Island Five is conspiracy theory at best, an enemy propaganda at worst.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T06:31:27-08:00","id":63408,"title":"","content":"I have completed the origin of my dusk. Here is the link to the google doc.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I have gone and accepted that we will be using the Silver Prince as our Deathlord.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/385-savare","name":"Savare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T06:42:32-08:00","id":63412,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Savare</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/abyssal-exalted/62895-abbandon-all-hope-all-ye-who-enter-here-i-m-doing-an-abyssal-game?p=63408#post63408\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have completed the origin of my dusk. Here is the link to the google doc.<br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/google-material/image_placeholder.svg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\"> https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rB5GFq5KvAu2QPVPWbew5fsXEc0tAVoZcbKf8Z_bVZ0/edit?usp=sharing </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> I have gone and accepted that we will be using the Silver Prince as our Deathlord.</div> </div> </div> </div>Great. Now can you contact me on skype? That would really be the easiest way.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T08:07:07-08:00","id":63433,"title":"","content":"Installing Skype now ..","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/385-savare","name":"Savare","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar385_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"29"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T13:01:10-08:00","id":63562,"title":"","content":"So, I have all the players I need! To everyone who wasn't able to get on board- I apologize, but this boat is sailing away. That concludes this thread, thank you everybody!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2052-frombeyond","name":"FromBeyond","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"426"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}